<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech c.bank sets CZK 8 bln bill auction Thursday.</title>
<headline>Czech c.bank sets CZK 8 bln bill auction Thursday.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Czech National Bank (CNB) has set a dutch auction of eight billion crowns in 13-week central bank bills for Thursday, the CNB said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The limit price for the auction is 967,000 crowns on bills with a nominal value of one million crowns, implying a gross yield of 13.5 percent. Bids are due at 1200 CET (1000 GMT) on Thursday.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 42-2-2423-0003</p>
</text>
